This project includes data from other projects:

Real-driver telemetry and track outlines
  Files:   frontend/public/reference/ and frontend/src/data/tracks.json
  Source:  TracingInsights 2025 archive, https://github.com/TracingInsights/2025
           (doi:10.5281/zenodo.17312803), exported with FastF1
           (https://github.com/theOehrly/Fast-F1, MIT License).
  License: Apache License 2.0, a copy is in frontend/public/reference/LICENSE.
  Changes: only each driver's fastest 2025 qualifying lap is kept, reduced to
           distance, time, speed, throttle, brake, gear and position,
           converted to metres and rounded. Track outlines are resampled to
           8 m spacing. Built by tools/build_reference.py and
           tools/build_tracks.py.

Game packet captures for tests
  Files:   tests/data/*.bin
  Source:  https://github.com/mini-sector/f1-packets (formerly
           11bthornton/f1-game-library-models)
  License: MIT License, Copyright 2025 Ben-Lukas Thornton, see tests/data/LICENSE.

